ear_family","contract_ref":"source-evidence/jin037-gaomi-nanyang/source-contract.json"},"lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-037","source_id":"s-jinshu037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018:p007","quote":"洛京傾覆，模使牙門趙染戍蒲阪，染求馮翊太守不得，怒，率眾降于劉聰。聰使其子粲及染攻長安，模使淳於定距之，為染所敗。士眾離叛，倉庫虛竭，軍祭酒韋輔曰：「事急矣，早降可以免。」模從之，遂降於染。染箕踞攘袂數模之罪，送詣粲。粲殺之，以模妃劉氏賜胡張本為妻。子保立。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018:p007:m0037","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018:p007:m0030"}],"interpretation_note":"本完整收到單元原詞與雙人物錨；不由列表補絕對排行或同母。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"name_components":[{"person_id":"r1a_o84_gzt","surname":"劉","ming":"粲","additional_names":[],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p009","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p009:m0178","quote":"及東海王越奉迎大駕，顒啟帝復穎還鄴，以志為魏郡太守，加左將軍，隨穎北鎮。行達洛陽，而平昌公模遣前鋒督護馮嵩距穎。穎還長安，未至而聞顒斬張方，求和於越。穎住華陰，志進長安，詣闕陳謝，即還就穎于武關。奔南陽，復為劉陶所驅，回詣河北。及穎薨，官屬奔散，唯志親自殯送，時人嘉之。越命志為軍諮祭酒，遷衛尉，永嘉末，轉尚書。洛陽沒，志將妻子北投并州刺史劉琨。至陽邑，為劉粲所虜，與次子謐、詵等俱遇害於平陽。長子諶。","note":"本段明寫劉粲／劉陶；本源可定名，但與他篇同名者分別記排除或未決。","status":"editorial_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","source_id":"s-jinshu044-lu-rendered-oldcapture"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018:p007:m0037","start":37,"end":38,"surface":"粲","kind":"person","person_id":"r1a_o84_gzt","status":"contextual_provisional","source_identity_role":"can","identity_reading_ref":"source-evidence/jin037-gaomi-nanyang/identity-readings.json#can","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018:p007","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nany