即諶之從母，既加親愛，又重其才地。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","source_position":{"rendered_tool_line":207,"capture_ref":"source-evidence/jin044-lu-rendered/received-rendered-capture.json","capture_kind":"existing_rendered_text_not_raw","projection":"remove leading ideographic spaces and tool-link wrappers only"},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p010:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"諶","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"依本篇角色及已列原段，首選沿用現役身份；限制另列。身份審讀：chen。","source_identity_role":"chen","identity_reading_ref":"source-evidence/jin044-lu-rendered/identity-readings.json#chen"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p010:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"子諒","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABBA","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"依本篇角色及已列原段，首選沿用現役身份；限制另列。身份審讀：chen。","source_identity_role":"chen","identity_reading_ref":"source-evidence/jin044-lu-rendered/identity-readings.json#chen"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p010:m0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"武帝","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAIA","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"依本篇角色及已列原段，首選沿用現役身份；限制另列。身份審讀：wudi。","source_identity_role":"wudi","identity_reading_ref":"source-evidence/jin044-lu-rendered/identity-readings.json#wudi"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p010:m0028","start":28,"end":32,"surface":"滎陽公主","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAIAS","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本篇來源內具名角色；跨篇同指未作肯定。身份審讀：gongzhu。","source_identity_role":"gongzhu","identity_reading_ref":"source-evidence/jin044-lu-rendered/identity-readings.json#gongzhu"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p010:m0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"公主","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAIAS","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本篇來源內具名角色；跨篇同指未作肯定。身份審讀：gongzhu。","source_identity_role":"go